Comparator noise spectrum, VACASK transient noise against VACASK noise analysis

// TEMPLATE. trannoise.py fills in the corner, temperature, VDD, VCM and
// reference current, the inn connection and the analysis lines, and writes
// two files per case:
//
//   <tag>_ss.sim  op, ac and noise, biased exactly like tb_noise.sim.tmpl:
//                 dout is fed back to inn through a 1 TH inductor, which
//                 parks the OTA at its own crossing condition (inn = dout =
//                 inp + Vos at DC) and opens the loop above a few microhertz;
//                 cinn (1 F) holds inn. The ac gives A(f) = outa / vinp, the
//                 noise analysis the small-signal input-referred PSD that
//                 RESULTS.md s.4 quotes.
//   <tag>.sim     the same circuit in the time domain with every device
//                 noise source injecting. inn is driven by a noiseless DC
//                 source at the V(inn) the _ss operating point found, which
//                 is the same small-signal circuit (cinn is an AC short).
//                 The inductor loop cannot be kept here: VACASK 764f693
//                 aborts a noisy tran with it ("Attempt to advance noise
//                 generator to last accepted time").
//
// Welch's PSD of v(outa) from <tag>.sim, divided by |A(f)|^2, must land on
// the noise analysis if the transient noise engine and the converted models
// are right; that is what licenses the jitter numbers of tb_tn_ramp.

ground 0

include "../gf180_03v3_@CORNER@.inc"
load "capacitor.osdi"
load "inductor.osdi"
model capacitor capacitor
model inductor inductor
model vsource vsource
model isource isource

include "../dut.inc"

vdd (vdd 0) vsource dc=@VDD@
vddb (vddb 0) vsource dc=@VDD@
irefn (vddb nbias) isource dc=@IREF@
xrefn (nbias nbias 0 0) nfet_03v3 l=1u w=20u nf=10 m=1
irefp (pbias 0) isource dc=@IREF@
@REFP@
vclk (clk 0) vsource dc=@VDD@

vinp (inp 0) vsource dc=@VCM@ mag=1
@INNBIAS@

xdut (inp inn dout clk vdd 0 nbias pbias) cmp
cload (dout 0) capacitor c=@CLOAD@

control
  var mm=0
  options temp=@TEMP@ tnom=27
  save v('xdut:outa') v(inn) v(dout)
@ANALYSES@
endc
